# Parts Specification: Stage 2 ECU Tune (Turbo Kit Calibration)

**SKU:** COBB-AP3-ST2

**Part ID:** 103

**Category:** Engine Management

**Manufacturer:** COBB Tuning

## Compatibility

Requires the turbo kit (`part_id 101`) and intercooler (`part_id 102`) to be fully installed and leak-tested before flashing.

Flashing a boost map onto a vehicle still running the stock turbo/intercooler can cause a boost-cut limp mode at best and engine damage at worst.

Also requires fuel injectors rated for the target power level (`part_id 105`) if the tune targets more than 320 whp. The stock injectors will run out of headroom and lean out above that threshold.

## Torque Specs

Not applicable — this is a software installation step, with no fasteners.

## Installation Order

**Install After:** `part_id 101`, `part_id 102`

The ECU tune must be applied after the turbo kit and intercooler are fully installed and leak-tested.

## Special Instructions

Flash with the vehicle on a full tank of the fuel octane the map was built for. 91 vs 93 AKI maps are not interchangeable.

Perform an initial low-boost "safe map" datalogging pull before committing to the full-boost map, and check for knock retard and AFR trend.